.\n\nSteps for installing BOB and Adapter Cables\n13.	Connect harness side and component side adapter cables to BOB\n14.	Connect ESD Drain Box on S/C harness for ~10 seconds \n15.	Remove ESD Drain Box from harness and connect to adapter cable going to S/C harness\n16.	Close all switches on the BOB and connect BOB assembly to< component> connector\n17.	After ~10 seconds open BOB switches and remove ESD Drain Box\n18.	Connect BOB assembly to S/C harness\nPrior to beginning any DMM measurements, simultaneously short test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\nRecord DMM info below:',1,361,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(1877,'Connect BOB assembly to Propulsion Harness P1905 and to S/C Harness J1905 using the steps outlined in 5.3.  Record BOB and Adapter Cable S/N#.',1,362,'Step 1',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(1878,'Verify all switches on the BOB are set to the “open” position.',2,362,'Step 2',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(1879,'Using a Digital Multi Meter (DMM) configured to measure resistance, perform the following checks and record values looking into Propulsion Harness P1905.  \n\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',3,362,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(1880,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',4,362,'Step 4',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(1881,'Using a DMM, perform the following checks and record values looking into the spacecraft harness connector J1905.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',5,362,'Step 5',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(18