here)',3,462,'Figure 6-1: Test Set-up for Section 6',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2392,'Prior to connecting BOBs to propulsion system or S/C harness connectors, any residual charge must be removed using an ESD Drain.\n\nSteps for installing BOB and Adapter Cables\n13.	Connect harness side and component side adapter cables to BOB\n14.	Connect ESD Drain Box on S/C harness for ~10 seconds \n15.	Remove ESD Drain Box from harness and connect to adapter cable going to S/C harness\n16.	Close all switches on the BOB and connect BOB assembly to< component> connector\n17.	After ~10 seconds open BOB switches and remove ESD Drain Box\n18.	Connect BOB assembly to S/C harness\nPrior to beginning any DMM measurements, simultaneously short test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\nRecord DMM info below:',1,463,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2393,'Connect BOB assembly to Propulsion Harness P1905 and to S/C Harness J1905 using the steps outlined in 5.3.  Record BOB and Adapter Cable S/N#.',1,464,'Step 1',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2394,'Verify all switches on the BOB are set to the “open” position.',2,464,'Step 2',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2395,'Using a Digital Multi Meter (DMM) configured to measure resistance, perform the following checks and record values looking into Propulsion Harness P1905.  \n\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',3,464,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2396,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',4,464,'Step 4',_binary '',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(2397,'Using a DMM, perform t