 operation.',1,1497,'Note',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7301,'The following test equipment will be needed for integration of the propulsion components.  \n	 \n•	Digital Multi-Meter \n•	Low Voltage Digital Multi-Meter\n•	Oscilloscope w/ probes\n•	BOBs and BOB Adapter Cables\n•	ESD Drain Box(s) \n',1,1498,'Note:',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7302,'Verify umbilical connectors are mated.',1,1499,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7303,'Verify the following arm plugs are installed to the spacecraft bulkhead panels: Thruster Arm +Y (P1906), Thruster Arm –Y (P4906), Catbed Heater Pri Arm (P4916), and Catbed Heater Red Arm (P4917).',2,1499,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7304,'(Attached figure goes here)',3,1499,'Figure 6-1: Test Set-up for Section 6',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7305,'Prior to connecting BOBs to propulsion system or S/C harness connectors, any residual charge must be removed using an ESD Drain.\n\nSteps for installing BOB and Adapter Cables\n13.	Connect harness side and component side adapter cables to BOB\n14.	Connect ESD Drain Box on S/C harness for ~10 seconds \n15.	Remove ESD Drain Box from harness and connect to adapter cable going to S/C harness\n16.	Close all switches on the BOB and connect BOB assembly to< component> connector\n17.	After ~10 seconds open BOB switches and remove ESD Drain Box\n18.	Connect BOB assembly to S/C harness\nPrior to beginning any DMM measurements, simultaneously short test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\nRecord DMM info below:',1,1500,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(