ments, simultaneously short test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\nRecord DMM info below:\n',2,1521,'Steps for installing BOB and Adapter Cables',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7406,'Connect BOB assembly to LV B J1 and to S/C Harness P1611 using the steps outlined in 5.3.  Record BOB and Adapter Cable S/N#.',1,1522,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7407,'Verify all switches on the BOB are set to the “open” position.',2,1522,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7408,'Using a Digital Multi Meter (DMM) configured to measure resistance, perform the following checks and record values looking into LV B J1.  \n\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',3,1522,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7409,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',4,1522,'Step 4',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7410,'Enter state of latch valve:\n\nIf measurement 5 to 6 = OL and 5 to 7 <= 2:	 LV is OPEN\n\nOR\n\nIf measurement 5 to 6 <= 2 and 5 to 7 = OL:	 LV is CLOSED\n',5,1522,'Step 5',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','SINGLE_VALUE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7411,'Using a DMM, perform the following checks and record values looking into the spacecraft harness connector P1611.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',6,1522,'Step 6',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7412,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',7,1522,'Step 7',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL