 scope per table below.',10,1591,'Step 10',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7720,'Continue script to fire thruster B3 upstream valve and then downstream valve, and verify thruster fire signals with DMM or scope per table below.',11,1591,'Step 11',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7721,'Continue script to fire thruster B4 upstream valve and then downstream valve, and verify thruster fire signals with DMM or scope per table below.',12,1591,'Step 12',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7722,'Continue script to fire thruster C3 upstream valve and then downstream valve, and verify thruster fire signals with DMM or scope per table below.',13,1591,'Step 13',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7723,'Continue script to fire thruster C4 upstream valve and then downstream valve, and verify thruster fire signals with DMM or scope per table below.',14,1591,'Step 14',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7724,'Continue script to send command to turn on the A Group Catbed Heaters, Service A.',1,1592,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7725,'With BOB switches open looking into harness, use DMM set to measure voltage to make the following measurements on harness connectors.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',2,1592,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7726,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',3,1592,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7727,'Continue script to send command to turn off the A Group Catbed Heaters, Service A and verify it is turned off (no voltage on same pins).',4,1592,'Step 4',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7728,'With BOB switches open looking into harness, use DMM set to measure voltage to make the following measurements on harness connectors.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',6,1592,'Step 6',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7729,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',7,1592,'Step 7',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7730,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',9,1592,'Step 11',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7731,'With BOB switches open looking into harness, use DMM set to measure voltage to make the following measurements on harness connectors.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',10,1592,'Step 10',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7732,'Continue script to send command to turn on the B Group Catbed Heaters, Service B.',11,1592,'Step 13',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7733,'Continue script to send command to turn off the A Group Catbed Heaters, Service B and verify it is turned off (no voltage on same pins).',13,1592,'Step 8',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7734,'Skipped the rest of section 6.4.2 and only included select sections of the rest of the test plan to expedite the software testing process.',14,1592,'Note:',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','ORIGINAL',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7735,'************************************************************************************\nNOTE:  The following sections contain test steps that require input and verification with initials of the Test Engineer and in some instances a QA inspector.  Blanks and Tables will indicate where data is required to be filled and/or a verification check is required.  Blanks with role (i.e. Q.A) indicate initials are required.\n************************************************************************************\n',1,1593,'Note:',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7736,'Inspect propulsion system for the following items:\n\n•	No nicks, dents or chipped paint\n•	Box and connector cleanliness \n•	Damaged connector pins\n•	Any Missing cable ties \n•	Box screws and connector jackposts are staked\n•	No split washers are used\n\nNote discrepancies/anomalies below and enter Anomaly Report in the SPP Anomaly Problem/Failure Reporting System (APFR) for any non-compliance.  Note any items from incoming Q.A. inspections if any.\n\n\n',1,1594,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','SINGLE_VALUE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7737,'Verify that each propulsion system connector is properly marked per the ICD.   Note the current configuration of each connector (i.e. connector saver installed, EMI cover installed, enable/disable plug installed, flight harness mated, etc. ',2,1594,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7738,'Verify propulsion system harnessing is labeled clearly and is consistent with ICD and Aerojet drawings. ',3,1594,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7739,'Take photographs at this time.  Photos should include views of connectors, labels and assembly part numbers at a minimum.  Place photos in following file location on the SES Davis Drive:\n',4,1594,'Step 4',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','SINGLE_VALUE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7740,'Use micro-ohmmeter to measure resistance from each connector shell to chassis ground for each propulsion system component connector.  Record measurement and verify against expected measurement in the table below.',1,1595,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7741,'Using a Micro Ohmmeter, verify less than 10 milliohms electrical resistance between each component and spacecraft deck.  Note: measurement should be made close to the ground strap point(s).  Record the following information in Step 2.1.',2,1595,'Step 2.1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7742,' ',3,1595,'Step 2.2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7743,'The following test equipment will be needed for integration of the propulsion components.  \n	 \nDigital Multi-Meter \nLow Voltage Digital Multi-Meter\nOscilloscope w/ probes\nBOBs and BOB Adapter Cables\nESD Drain Box(s) \n',1,1597,'Note:',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7744,'Verify umbilical connectors are mated.',1,1598,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7745,'Verify the following arm plugs are installed to the spacecraft test panel: Prop Arm A (P0001), Prop Arm B (P0002), and Prop Test (P0003).',2,1598,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7746,'Prior to connecting BOBs to propulsion system or S/C harness connectors, any residual charge must be removed using an ESD Drain.\n\nSteps for installing BOB and Adapter Cables\n1.	Connect harness side and component side adapter cables to BOB\n2.	Connect ESD Drain Box on S/C harness for ~10 seconds \n3.	Remove ESD Drain Box from harness and connect to adapter cable going to S/C harness\n4.	Close all switches on the BOB and connect BOB assembly to< component> connector\n5.	After ~10 seconds open BOB switches and remove ESD Drain Box\n6.	Connect BOB assembly to S/C harness\nPrior to beginning any DMM measurements, simultaneously short test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\nRecord DMM info below:\n',1,1599,'Note:',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7747,'Connect BOB assembly to PT A J1 and to S/C Harness P1621 using the steps outlined in 5.3.  Record BOB and Adapter Cable S/N#.',1,1600,'Step 1',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7748,'Verify all switches on the BOB are set to the “open” position.',2,1600,'Step 2',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7749,'Using a Digital Multi Meter (DMM) configured to measure resistance, perform the following checks and record values looking into PT A J1.  \n\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',3,1600,'Step 3',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7750,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',4,1600,'Step 4',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7751,'Using a DMM, perform the following checks and record values looking into the spacecraft harness connector P1621.\n\nshort test leads together and to S/C ground to remove any residual charge.\n',5,1600,'Step 5',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','TABLE','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7752,'Verify the measured values are within the expected values in above table.',6,1600,'Step 6',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',_binary '\0','CHECKBOX','RUN',NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0'),(7753,'Leave BOB and adapter cables mated for next section.',7,1600,'Step 7',_binary